/SPT><SPT><TTL>PRE-INSTALLATION MEETINGS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Delete this paragraph if the requirements are included in Section
<SRF> 01 30 00</SRF> ADMINISTRATIVE REQUIREMENTS, Section <SRF>01 32 01.00 10</SRF> PROJECT SCHEDULE, 
